{% comment %}
  Section: Bandeau vidéo
  Vidéo Shopify ou vidéo externe (YouTube / Vimeo), en fond plein écran
  ou intégrée dans la largeur du conteneur, avec overlay et bloc de contenu.
  La lecture automatique est appliquée en JavaScript afin de respecter
  prefers-reduced-motion, impossible à détecter côté Liquid.
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  comment
    Polarite du plancher de lisibilite : sombre sous un texte clair, clair
    sous un texte sombre.
  endcomment
  assign vb_lightness = section.settings.text_color | color_extract: 'lightness'
  if vb_lightness > 50
    assign vb_floor_rgb = '26, 22, 18'
  else
    assign vb_floor_rgb = '250, 249, 247'
  endif
-%}

{%- style -%}
  .video-banner {
    position: relative;
    background-color: {{ section.settings.background_color }};
    {% render 'section-tokens', bg: section.settings.background_color, text: section.settings.text_color %}
  }

  .video-banner [hidden] {
    display: none !important;
  }

  .video-banner--background {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: {{ section.settings.height }}vh;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .video-banner--inline {
    padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--container-padding);
  }

  .video-banner__media-wrap {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: #000000;
  }

  .video-banner--background .video-banner__media-wrap {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .video-banner--inline .video-banner__media-wrap {
    max-width: var(--container-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
  }

  .video-banner__media {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .video-banner__video,
  .video-banner__iframe,
  .video-banner__cover,
  .video-banner__media .placeholder-svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border: 0;
  }

  .video-banner__overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 1;
    pointer-events: none;
    background-color: rgba({{ section.settings.overlay_color.red }}, {{ section.settings.overlay_color.green }}, {{ section.settings.overlay_color.blue }}, {{ section.settings.overlay_opacity }});
  }

  /* Plancher de lisibilite, de la polarite du texte : le voile reglable seul
     laissait le titre a 1,05:1 avec un texte sombre pose dans la page. */
  .video-banner__overlay::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-color: rgba({{ vb_floor_rgb }}, 0.45);
  }

  .video-banner__controls {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .video-banner__controls--corner {
    right: var(--spacing-sm);
    bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
  }

  .video-banner__controls--center {
    inset: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .video-banner__control {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 3rem;
    height: 3rem;
    padding: 0;
    border: 1px solid #ffffff;
    border-radius: 50%;
    /* PLAQUE OPAQUE, et non rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55) : a travers un fond translucide,
       c'est la video qui decidait du contraste de l'icone. Mesure du 22/10/2026
       sur le thème d'essai, accueil en 390 : l'icone, blanche en CSS (10,49:1
       sur le papier), etait rendue #82807e sur #2f2d24, soit 2,93:1 pour un
       seuil de 3:1 — et le chiffre changeait d'une mesure a l'autre selon
       l'image affichee a l'instant de la capture. Sur un media, aucune couleur
       du theme ne garantit quoi que ce soit : on prend la paire fixe sombre +
       blanc, deja utilisee pour les anneaux poses sur une image. */
    background-color: #1a1a1a;
    color: #ffffff;
    cursor: pointer;
    pointer-events: auto;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast), border-color var(--transition-fast), transform var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .video-banner__control--play {
    width: 4.5rem;
    height: 4.5rem;
  }

  .video-banner__control:hover {
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
    border-color: #ffffff;
  }

  {%- comment -%}
    Pas de regle :focus-visible ici, meme raison que la fleche du diaporama :
    l'anneau blanc pose 3 px dehors valait de 6,6 a 14,5:1 selon l'image de la
    video (mesure du 23/10/2026). L'anneau en deux tons d'assets/theme.css tient
    sur une image claire comme sombre.
  {%- endcomment -%}

  .video-banner__content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 3;
    max-width: 720px;
    padding: var(--spacing-md);
    text-align: {{ section.settings.text_alignment }};
  }

  .video-banner--inline .video-banner__content {
    max-width: var(--container-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--spacing-md) 0 0;
  }

  .video-banner__title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: {{ section.settings.text_color }};
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
  }

  .video-banner__text {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: {{ section.settings.text_color }};
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
  }

  .video-banner__content[data-alignment="center"] .video-banner__text {
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .video-banner__content[data-alignment="right"] .video-banner__text {
    margin-left: auto;
  }

  .video-banner__button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: none;
    background-color: {{ section.settings.button_bg }};
    color: {{ section.settings.button_text }};
    transition: background-color var(--transition-base), color var(--transition-base), transform var(--transition-base);
  }

  .video-banner__button:hover {
    background-color: {{ section.settings.button_bg | color_darken: 10 }};
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .video-banner__content {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .video-banner--background {
      min-height: {{ section.settings.height_mobile }}vh;
    }
    .video-banner--inline .video-banner__media-wrap {
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    }
    .video-banner__button {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 320px;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .video-banner__control--play {
      width: 3.5rem;
      height: 3.5rem;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .video-banner__button:hover {
      transform: none;
    }
    .video-banner__control:hover {
      transform: none;
    }
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

{%- liquid
  assign has_native_video = false
  assign has_external_video = false
  if section.settings.video != blank
    assign has_native_video = true
  elsif section.settings.video_url != blank
    assign has_external_video = true
  endif
-%}

<div
  class="video-banner video-banner--{{ section.settings.layout }}"
  id="VideoBanner-{{ section.id }}"
  data-section-id="{{ section.id }}"
  {% comment -%} Media plein cadre : l'en-tete transparent peut se superposer. {%- endcomment -%}
  data-header-overlay
>
  <div class="video-banner__media-wrap">
    <div
      class="video-banner__media"
      {% if has_external_video %}
        data-video-embed
        data-video-type="{{ section.settings.video_url.type | escape }}"
        data-video-id="{{ section.settings.video_url.id | escape }}"
        data-iframe-title="{{ 'sections.video_banner.iframe_title' | t }}"
        {% if section.settings.autoplay %}data-autoplay="true"{% endif %}
      {% endif %}
    >
      {%- if has_native_video -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          preload : meme defaut que le heros (N1). « metadata » tirait 1,07 Mo de
          HLS en 5 fichiers des le chargement alors que la video reste en pause
          sous prefers-reduced-motion, 2,18 Mo sans mouvement reduit (mesure du
          23/10/2026, thème d'essai, page des 22 sections a 1440). Des qu'une
          image de couverture peint le premier ecran, on ne precharge rien ; le
          play() plus bas, ou le clic du visiteur, declenche le chargement. Sans
          couverture, « metadata » reste la seule facon de montrer la premiere
          image. Ecrit en 1.7.0, retire avant sa sortie parce que la video qui
          tournait faussait la mesure d'anneau du bouton rond ; a11y.cjs fige
          desormais les videos (kiosk-outils ac9872a) et la regle revient en 1.7.1.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <video
          class="video-banner__video"
          data-video-native
          {% if section.settings.autoplay %}data-autoplay="true"{% else %}controls{% endif %}
          loop
          muted
          playsinline
          preload="{% if section.settings.cover_image != blank %}none{% else %}metadata{% endif %}"
          {% if section.settings.video.alt != blank %}aria-label="{{ section.settings.video.alt | escape }}"{% endif %}
          {% if section.settings.cover_image != blank %}poster="{{ section.settings.cover_image | image_url: width: 1920 }}"{% endif %}
        >
          {%- for source in section.settings.video.sources -%}
            <source src="{{ source.url }}" type="{{ source.mime_type }}">
          {%- endfor -%}
        </video>
      {%- elsif section.settings.cover_image != blank -%}
        <img
          srcset="{%- if section.settings.cover_image.width >= 375 -%}{{ section.settings.cover_image | image_url: width: 375 }} 375w,{%- endif -%}
            {%- if section.settings.cover_image.width >= 750 -%}{{ section.settings.cover_image | image_url: width: 750 }} 750w,{%- endif -%}
            {%- if section.settings.cover_image.width >= 1100 -%}{{ section.settings.cover_image | image_url: width: 1100 }} 1100w,{%- endif -%}
            {%- if section.settings.cover_image.width >= 1500 -%}{{ section.settings.cover_image | image_url: width: 1500 }} 1500w,{%- endif -%}
            {%- if section.settings.cover_image.width >= 1920 -%}{{ section.settings.cover_image | image_url: width: 1920 }} 1920w,{%- endif -%}"
          src="{{ section.settings.cover_image | image_url: width: 1920 }}"
          sizes="100vw"
          alt="{{ section.settings.cover_image.alt | escape }}"
          class="video-banner__cover"
          {% comment %}
            Cette section porte un preset : elle peut ouvrir la page, et son
            image de couverture est alors l'image LCP. « lazy » en dur la
            retardait systematiquement. Meme regle que image-with-text.liquid.
          {% endcomment %}
          {%- if section.index <= 2 -%}
            loading="eager"
            {%- if section.index == 1 %} fetchpriority="high"{% endif -%}
          {%- else -%}
            loading="lazy"
          {%- endif %}
          {% render 'focal', image: section.settings.cover_image %}
          width="{{ section.settings.cover_image.width }}"
          height="{{ section.settings.cover_image.height }}"
        >
      {%- else -%}
        <span class="placeholder-wrap" aria-hidden="true">{{ 'lifestyle-1' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'placeholder-svg' }}</span>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- if section.settings.layout == 'background' -%}
      <div class="video-banner__overlay"></div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if has_native_video and section.settings.autoplay -%}
      <div class="video-banner__controls video-banner__controls--corner" data-video-controls>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="video-banner__control"
          data-video-toggle
          data-label-play="{{ 'sections.video_banner.play' | t }}"
          data-label-pause="{{ 'sections.video_banner.pause' | t }}"
          aria-label="{{ 'sections.video_banner.pause' | t }}"
        >
          <span class="video-banner__icon" data-icon-pause>
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="6" y="5" width="4" height="14"/><rect x="14" y="5" width="4" height="14"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="video-banner__icon" data-icon-play hidden>
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>
          </span>
        </button>
      </div>
    {%- elsif has_external_video -%}
      <div class="video-banner__controls video-banner__controls--center" data-video-controls>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="video-banner__control video-banner__control--play"
          data-video-play
          aria-label="{{ 'sections.video_banner.play' | t }}"
        >
          <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  {%- if section.settings.title != blank or section.settings.text != blank or section.settings.button_label != blank -%}
    <div class="video-banner__content" data-alignment="{{ section.settings.text_alignment }}">
      {%- if section.settings.title != blank -%}
        <h2 class="video-banner__title">{{ section.settings.title | escape }}</h2>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.text != blank -%}
        <p class="video-banner__text">{{ section.settings.text | escape }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.button_label != blank and section.settings.button_link != blank -%}
        <a href="{% render 'lien-localise', url: section.settings.button_link %}" class="video-banner__button">
          {{ section.settings.button_label | escape }}
          {% render 'icon', icon: 'arrow-right' %}
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>

<script>
  (function () {
    var root = document.getElementById('VideoBanner-' + {{ section.id | json }});
    if (!root) return;

    /* Idempotence PAR SECTION, comme countdown:323, faq:219, slideshow:589 et
       tabs:359. En 1.6.1 le drapeau etait pose sur document.documentElement,
       donc global : apres un rechargement de section le script sortait tout de
       suite et le bouton Pause restait inerte (libelle et paused inchanges,
       mesure 1.6.1), et une 2e section video-banner — le preset n'a pas de
       limit — ne s'initialisait jamais. Une racine neuve n'a pas le drapeau. */
    if (root.dataset.videoBannerInit === 'true') return;
    root.dataset.videoBannerInit = 'true';

    var prefersReducedMotion =
      window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;

    /* Vidéo Shopify : l'attribut autoplay est ajouté en JS pour ne jamais
       démarrer une lecture chez un visiteur qui réduit les animations. */
    var video = root.querySelector('[data-video-native]');
    if (video) {
      var toggle = root.querySelector('[data-video-toggle]');
      var iconPlay = toggle ? toggle.querySelector('[data-icon-play]') : null;
      var iconPause = toggle ? toggle.querySelector('[data-icon-pause]') : null;

      var syncToggle = function () {
        if (!toggle) return;
        var playing = !video.paused && !video.ended;
        toggle.setAttribute(
          'aria-label',
          playing ? toggle.getAttribute('data-label-pause') : toggle.getAttribute('data-label-play')
        );
        if (iconPlay) iconPlay.hidden = playing;
        if (iconPause) iconPause.hidden = !playing;
      };

      if (video.hasAttribute('data-autoplay') && !prefersReducedMotion) {
        video.setAttribute('autoplay', '');
        var playback = video.play();
        if (playback && typeof playback.catch === 'function') {
          playback.catch(function () {
            syncToggle();
          });
        }
      } else if (video.hasAttribute('data-autoplay')) {
        video.setAttribute('controls', '');
        var corner = root.querySelector('[data-video-controls]');
        if (corner) corner.hidden = true;
      }

      if (toggle) {
        toggle.addEventListener('click', function () {
          if (video.paused) {
            video.play();
          } else {
            video.pause();
          }
        });
        video.addEventListener('play', syncToggle);
        video.addEventListener('pause', syncToggle);
        syncToggle();
      }
    }

    /* Vidéo externe : la façade (image + bouton) ne charge le lecteur
       tiers qu'au clic, ou au chargement si la lecture auto est demandée. */
    var facade = root.querySelector('[data-video-embed]');
    if (facade) {
      var loaded = false;

      var loadEmbed = function (autoplay) {
        if (loaded) return;
        loaded = true;

        var type = facade.getAttribute('data-video-type');
        var id = encodeURIComponent(facade.getAttribute('data-video-id') || '');
        var src;

        if (type === 'vimeo') {
          src =
            'https://player.vimeo.com/video/' +
            id +
            '?loop=1&playsinline=1&dnt=1&title=0&byline=0&portrait=0' +
            (autoplay ? '&autoplay=1&muted=1' : '');
        } else {
          src =
            'https://www.youtube.com/embed/' +
            id +
            '?loop=1&rel=0&playsinline=1&playlist=' +
            id +
            (autoplay ? '&autoplay=1&mute=1' : '');
        }

        var iframe = document.createElement('iframe');
        iframe.className = 'video-banner__iframe';
        iframe.setAttribute('src', src);
        iframe.setAttribute('title', facade.getAttribute('data-iframe-title') || '');
        iframe.setAttribute('allow', 'autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture; fullscreen');
        iframe.setAttribute('allowfullscreen', '');
        iframe.setAttribute('loading', 'lazy');

        facade.innerHTML = '';
        facade.appendChild(iframe);

        var controls = root.querySelector('[data-video-controls]');
        if (controls) controls.hidden = true;
      };

      var trigger = root.querySelector('[data-video-play]');
      if (trigger) {
        trigger.addEventListener('click', function () {
          loadEmbed(true);
        });
      }

      if (facade.hasAttribute('data-autoplay') && !prefersReducedMotion) {
        loadEmbed(true);
      }
    }
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:sections.video_banner.name",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-video-banner",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.header__1.content"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.title.label",
      "default": "The collection film"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "text",
      "label": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.text.label",
      "default": "A few minutes behind the scenes in the atelier, between the work of the hand and materials chosen one by one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "button_label",
      "label": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.button_label.label",
      "default": "View the collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "button_link",
      "label": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.button_link.label"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.header__2.content"
    },
    {
      "type": "video",
      "id": "video",
      "label": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.video.label",
      "info": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.video.info"
    },
    {
      "type": "video_url",
      "id": "video_url",
      "accept": ["youtube", "vimeo"],
      "label": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.video_url.label",
      "info": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.video_url.info",
      "placeholder": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.video_url.placeholder"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "cover_image",
      "label": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.cover_image.label",
      "info": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.cover_image.info"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "autoplay",
      "label": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.autoplay.label",
      "info": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.autoplay.info",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.header__3.content"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "layout",
      "label": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.layout.label",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "background",
          "label": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.layout.options__1.label"
        },
        {
          "value": "inline",
          "label": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.layout.options__2.label"
        }
      ],
      "default": "background"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "text_alignment",
      "label": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.text_alignment.label",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "left",
          "label": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.text_alignment.options__1.label"
        },
        {
          "value": "center",
          "label": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.text_alignment.options__2.label"
        },
        {
          "value": "right",
          "label": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.text_alignment.options__3.label"
        }
      ],
      "default": "center"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "height",
      "min": 40,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 5,
      "default": 80,
      "unit": "vh",
      "label": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.height.label",
      "info": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.height.info"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "height_mobile",
      "min": 40,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 5,
      "default": 60,
      "unit": "vh",
      "label": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.height_mobile.label"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.header__4.content"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "background_color",
      "label": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.background_color.label",
      "default": "#1a1a1a"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "text_color",
      "label": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.text_color.label",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "overlay_color",
      "label": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.overlay_color.label",
      "default": "#000000"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "overlay_opacity",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 1,
      "step": 0.1,
      "default": 0.4,
      "label": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.overlay_opacity.label",
      "info": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.overlay_opacity.info"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "button_bg",
      "label": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.button_bg.label",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "button_text",
      "label": "t:sections.video_banner.settings.button_text.label",
      "default": "#1a1a1a"
    }
  ],
